/*
  BackgroundWorkersCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0240 · BackgroundWorkersCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `BackgroundWorkersCard` resolves (table "BackgroundWorkersCard") lives here with
  the web English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The web source (features/system/components/status/BackgroundWorkersCard.tsx) is
  anonymous (it renders literal English, no t() calls). The first group reproduces
  that verbatim copy as keyed strings; the second group backs the native-only
  chrome (title / Refresh / stale / offline chips, retry, loading, accessibility)
  the Apple HIG states contract requires.
*/

